OL,3,GNEWSAAge UK in-person service to close
OL,4,Ain a few weeks
OL,5,
OL,6,FHe said: "Losing that provision, or
OL,7,Fseeing it substantially reduced, has
OL,8,Fenormous consequences. It affects not
OL,9,Fonly Dad's wellbeing and quality of
OL,10,Flife but also our ability to provide
OL,11,Fthe care he needs."
